{"id":346385,"date":"2020-08-11T22:41:13","date_gmt":"2020-08-11T22:41:13","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=346385"},"modified":"2020-08-11T22:42:16","modified_gmt":"2020-08-11T22:42:16","slug":"repeater-site-cameras-and-fcc-speed-test","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2020\/08\/11\/repeater-site-cameras-and-fcc-speed-test\/","title":{"rendered":"Repeater Site Cameras and FCC Speed Test"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>CalFire and PG&amp;E have recently placed high definition cameras at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.alertwildfire.org\/southeastbay\/index.html?camera=Axis-Kregor&amp;v=81e004f\">Kregor Peak<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/www.alertwildfire.org\/southeastbay\/index.html?camera=Axis-VollmerTowerTop&amp;v=81e004f\">Bald Peak <\/a>and <a href=\"http:\/\/www.alertwildfire.org\/southeastbay\/index.html?camera=Axis-HighlandPeak&amp;v=81e004f\">Highland Peak<\/a>.  These cameras provide access to state-of-the-art Pan-Tilt-Zoom (PTZ) fire cameras and associated tools to help firefighters and first responders.  You can use the above links to access these camera as well as the CCRA website &#8220;<a href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/coverage\/\">Coverage<\/a>&#8221; tab.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>On August 3rd the FCC released a Speed Test App for <a href=\"https:\/\/play.google.com\/store\/apps\/details?id=com.samknows.fcc&amp;hl=en_US\">Android<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/apps.apple.com\/us\/app\/fcc-speed-test\/id794322383\">Apple iOS<\/a> operating systems.  I&#8217;ve downloaded the app for the Android and it works well and doesn&#8217;t have any commercials.  For more information on the <a href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/08\/DOC-365915A1.pdf\">FCC Speed Test<\/a> please check the CCRA Blog.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>CalFire and PG&amp;E have recently placed high definition cameras at Kregor Peak, Bald Peak and Highland Peak. These cameras provide access to state-of-the-art Pan-Tilt-Zoom (PTZ) fire cameras and associated tools <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2020\/08\/11\/repeater-site-cameras-and-fcc-speed-test\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-346385","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/p69ory-1s6R","_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/346385","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=346385"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/346385\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":346387,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/346385\/revisions\/346387"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=346385"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=346385"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=346385"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}